  "content": {
    "id": "v2-70928-p46-practice-slot-9-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "A loan of $\\$8000$ is paid back in equal annual instalments over 4 years. If the interest is 15% p.a., find the amount of each annual instalment to the nearest cent.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$2802.12$ annually.",
      "worked": "Let each annual instalment be $M$ and $r=1.15$.\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\text{Start: }&8000\\\\\\text{1st repayment: }&8000r-M\\\\\\text{2nd repayment: }&8000r^2-Mr-M\\\\\\text{4th repayment: }&8000r^4-Mr^3-Mr^2-Mr-M\\end{aligned}$$\nThe repayments form a geometric series with $a=M,\\ r=1.15,\\ n=4$. When the loan is repaid, the balance is zero.\n$$\\begin{align*}0&=8000(1.15)^4-M\\left[\\frac{1.15^4-1}{1.15-1}\\right]\\\\M&=\\frac{8000(1.15)^4(0.15)}{1.15^4-1}\\\\M&\\approx\\$2802.12\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": null
  },
